---
import { Picture } from "astro:assets";
import logsShot from "@/assets/screens/02-logs.webp";
---

<section class="border-y border-border bg-card/60 py-section" aria-labelledby="hlodi-naslov">
  <div class="container-page grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12">
    <div class="order-2 lg:order-1 lg:col-span-5" data-reveal>
      <div class="mx-auto w-[70%] max-w-[19rem] overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border-[6px] border-muted shadow-2xl shadow-black/50 lg:mx-0">
        <Picture
          src={logsShot}
          formats={["webp"]}
          fallbackFormat="webp"
          width={304}
          widths={[260, 304, 608]}
          sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 304px, 70vw"
          alt="Zavihek Hlodi: 5 hlodov, skupaj 2,57 m³, razvrščeni po vrstah Bukev in Smreka"
          loading="lazy"
          class="block h-auto w-full"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="order-1 lg:order-2 lg:col-span-7" data-reveal>
      <h2 id="hlodi-naslov" class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight sm:text-5xl">
        Izmerite hlod. Gozdar izračuna ostalo.
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-lg text-muted-foreground">
        Vpišete premer in dolžino, aplikacija izračuna prostornino. Vsak hlod dobi drevesno vrsto, opombo in GPS lokacijo, da ga kasneje najdete na karti.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-9 max-w-xl rounded-lg border border-border bg-background p-6 sm:p-7">
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-muted-foreground">
          <span>Premer <strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">45 cm</strong></span>
          <span>Dolžina <strong class="font-semibold text-foreground">4,5 m</strong></span>
          <span class="text-faint">→</span>
          <span class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold text-primary">0,716 m³</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 font-mono text-sm text-faint">V = π × (d / 200)² × L</p>
      </div>

      <ul class="mt-8 grid max-w-xl gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <li class="border-t border-border pt-3">
          <p class="font-semibold">Po vrstah</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-[0.95rem] text-muted-foreground">Smreka, bukev, jelka ali vaše vrste. Hlodi se razvrstijo sami, z vsoto za vsako vrsto.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="border-t border-border pt-3">
          <p class="font-semibold">m³, PRM in NM</p>
          <p class="mt-1 text-[0.95rem] text-muted-foreground">Skupna prostornina v kubikih, prostorninskih in nasutih metrih. Faktorje pretvorbe nastavite sami.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
